{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "4aaa0eb28be089ea440ed054c90f1bd67954606b652a5a50a9857fef86f4cbee", "ja": "ふたりは仲良し双子姉妹！なのです", "zh": "我们是要好的双胞胎姊妹喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "9f75af64b0e1cd99e66c227823a3375e917c33c640301b6e3d85b9c3c1517e15", "ja": "プロデューサーが衣装の相談をすると、\n仲良く悩むまつりとエミリー。真や雪歩、\n貴音、亜美と真美から学んだ心得を実践し、\n公演までに更に完璧な双子のお姫様ユニット\nになってみせると口を揃えて語るのだった。", "zh": "制作人找茉莉及艾蜜莉讨论服装问题，\n两人很有默契地一同烦恼。\n她们异口同声地表示，要实践向真和雪步、\n贵音、亚美和真美学习到的要领，\n在公演前成为更完美的公主团体。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_06_1000_null", "source_sha256": "6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e", "ja": "数日後……", "zh": "过了几天后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_06_1001_p", "source_sha256": "ecf428096612f8a256f27ead12ff6b287cfbb99af77515b4dfd8221ef4dc6990", "ja": "まつり、エミリー、ちょっといいか？\n相談があるんだけど。", "zh": "茉莉、艾蜜莉，可以打扰一下吗？\n我有事想跟你们商量。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_06_1002_021mat", "source_sha256": "beac41b43ae87578b0af50651edf65e44c699d9cf33cac5c6d14f4d727ea8017", "ja": "はいなのです。", "zh": "好的喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_06_1003_032emi", "source_sha256": "f8abe4319a2d21b1bea348b3865fbce0a4a92c03a34617ebb54ec660174a7c36", "ja": "どうしたのですか？\n仕掛け人さま。", "zh": "请问有什么事吗，\n策划执行人先生？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_06_1004_p", "source_sha256": "ae987366a90809c27ea8b776c054a326f8d52a2fe8a3c3b6379704289922ad50", "ja": "うん。ここに飾る、リボンの色に悩んでいて……。\nふたりは、何色がいいと思う？", "zh": "嗯，我在烦恼装饰在这里的缎带颜色……\n你们觉得什么颜色好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_06_1005_032emi", "source_sha256": "37c31faea4caaba31abf7b8e17a2a135159fd193141b733fc9914592cb322754", "ja": "水色でしょうか？　それとも、桃色……？", "zh": "浅蓝色吧？或是桃红色……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_06_1006_021mat", "source_sha256": "4d3490cc1ac88d2683a70f94a57446359f701c2024a5c2948cf0d1c0f70a0da8", "ja": "紺地に金のラインもかわいいし、\n真っ赤なリボンもときめくのです。", "zh": "深蓝色底加上金线很可爱，\n大红色的蝴蝶结也令人心动的喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_06_1007_032emi", "source_sha256": "eb25843a79d5af323e567ae2fc74e38b3af243d7f286edf3916832e4c394d1b5", "ja": "どうしましょー？", "zh": "怎么办呢──？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_06_1008_021mat", "source_sha256": "a7ee2dc5c2a6f2280869ce1d0e24ebc764deb1c1dc67efab626b2dc77b838c34", "ja": "どうしましょう？", "zh": "怎么办呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_06_1009_p", "source_sha256": "d6515056ea812bd19cadced52be4f2776586aa1c8b4748acee19ce161a6eb756", "ja": "ん？\n……何だかふたりとも、似てきてないか？", "zh": "嗯？\n……你们是不是越来越像了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_06_1010_032emi", "source_sha256": "4557f7f438027a89fb4fed788d3f3a873e9c319a768e23ac0730915e77ea1dd5", "ja": "そうかもしれませんね。劇場にいる間は、\nまつりさんとふたりで過ごしていますし……。", "zh": "也许是呢，待在剧场的时间，\n我都是和茉莉一起度过的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_06_1011_021mat", "source_sha256": "bc4d9917d94954f35f3f534a46e9f57433923a3d514b8384ca0d8f530b537b2b", "ja": "それに、コンセプトは『双子のお姫様』なのです。\n意識していれば、似てくるのも当然なのです。", "zh": "而且主题是『双胞胎公主』的喔，\n只要心怀这个念头，越来越像也是当然的喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_06_1012_032emi", "source_sha256": "9f79b64b15730c69ef5b634ac496e79d0c3ecd1d4ba4a15515cc5c65a9ec683a", "ja": "まつりさんの、言うとおりなのです。\n……あっ。", "zh": "就跟茉莉说的一样的喔。\n……啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_06_1013_p", "source_sha256": "416a7b302ab2294ee87a65e134cb0526ad36f05e0c1ed49ed60c789c171c71de", "ja": "はは、口調まで似てきちゃったみたいだな。", "zh": "哈哈，连说话方式都越来越像了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_06_1014_032emi", "source_sha256": "d9b478006cd7447bb29ffc9445593825b0acdbbd0e84cc3e503a910372ea206f", "ja": "も、申し訳ありません。あの、真似をしようと\n思ったわけではないのですが、自然に……。", "zh": "非、非常抱歉，\n我没有打算要模仿，但自然而然就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_06_1015_021mat", "source_sha256": "405b870551a36f0cf4cb55b7bff607e749fe3d3bdaca981f66f27fff6040f092", "ja": "姫とずっと一緒にいたら、そうなるのです。\nエミリーちゃんは、そういうお年頃なのです。", "zh": "只要一直跟公主在一起，就会这样的喔，\n小艾蜜莉正值这个年纪的呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_06_1016_032emi", "source_sha256": "37da84d583e05cafc0464cc26fdbfcfe5974cb677a961761f6a707f54d84a2c9", "ja": "そうですね……このままでは、私とまつりさん、\nふたりでひとつになってしまうかもしれませんね？", "zh": "对呀……继续这样下去，\n我和茉莉说不定会合而为一喔？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_06_1017_021mat", "source_sha256": "37919d2ad2556f57052adfde795e9ca46c8539bad572baa0a04de955f2dace69", "ja": "ふたりでひとつ、素敵なのです！\nますます、双子に近づいていくのです。", "zh": "合而为一，真是美好的喔！\n越来越接近双胞胎了喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_06_1018_021mat", "source_sha256": "e31042b49c0e7779db55ab13648f79064486305d1aecb2cd7feac61be2dee7d9", "ja": "ふふふふふ……。", "zh": "呵呵呵呵呵……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_06_1019_032emi", "source_sha256": "e31042b49c0e7779db55ab13648f79064486305d1aecb2cd7feac61be2dee7d9", "ja": "ふふふふふ……。", "zh": "呵呵呵呵呵……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_06_1020_p", "source_sha256": "ae7dce72fab178bb3982e0f2bc8f0a2ee61c89efb205f6e4ff409aedece80cf5", "ja": "な、何だか、ちょっと怖い感じもするけど……。\n『お姫様講座』のアドバイス、役に立ったみたいだな。", "zh": "总、总觉得有点恐怖……\n但『公主讲座』的建议似乎有派上用场呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_06_1021_021mat", "source_sha256": "045c0e5978499589d5f95dde32070569ef796298f26ebe70c3c809258a7118b3", "ja": "はいなのです。真ちゃんと雪歩ちゃんに教わった、\n『相手を理解すること』。", "zh": "是的喔，从小真和小雪步身上学到的\n『理解对方』。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_06_1022_032emi", "source_sha256": "9eb52fd50413f0749b2ef02b0f44d830d46d373348b96272b766902c92923e60", "ja": "貴音さまから教わった、\n『自分達らしさを忘れないこと』……。", "zh": "从贵音小姐身上学到的\n『不要忘记自己的风格』……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_06_1023_021mat", "source_sha256": "a6e3dac487ac22d691a039464e4704913d878f715aef66d1d74670ce7e2b886a", "ja": "亜美ちゃんと真美ちゃんから教わった、\n『いつも一緒にいること』。", "zh": "从小亚美和小真美身上学到的\n『形影不离』。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_06_1024_032emi", "source_sha256": "979e6bff45c32c2e2e243d0bd09e997351743e2555709cea733f66d3d3d13b82", "ja": "教えていただいた心得を、完璧に実践して、\n私たちは、必ず……。", "zh": "我们会完美实践学到的要领，\n然后一定要……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_06_1025_021mat", "source_sha256": "f34cd8e066d0cf872beef7ede1a8d6e76d745aecbba5dfe678207579c7e13776", "ja": "双子のお姫様ユニットを、\n『ぱーふぇくと／完璧』！に完成させるのです！", "zh": "要『完美』地打造出\n双胞胎公主团体喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_06_1026_032emi", "source_sha256": "0ca2af9e3829e9dcb53d0fd481e37c273a78847218ee3188ba99ffd012a2a62b", "ja": "双子のお姫様ユニットを、\n完璧！に完成させるのです！", "zh": "要完美地打造出\n双胞胎公主团体喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_06_1027_032emi", "source_sha256": "944853d56901d51bcb989e4e8e4d6cef90c4b05da5cd00351cb1afa8f4b18de4", "ja": "Oh！　わ、私ったら、つい……！", "zh": "Oh！我、我真是的，一不小心就……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_06_1028_021mat", "source_sha256": "64fa7a6ac4a3fe5898173ada4b6ca835a56b06b001581321cf462760187a33bd", "ja": "わんだほー！なのです。姫とエミリーちゃん、\nピッタリ揃ってしまったのです。", "zh": "真是太美妙了呀！\n公主和小艾蜜莉说出了一模一样的话喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_06_1029_021mat", "source_sha256": "0af5a9f5471e80e046f8482a88055b5d57d1048ce3585a766bf77a812274435d", "ja": "エミリーちゃん。この調子で、歌もダンスも\nピッタリ揃えていくのです♪", "zh": "小艾蜜莉，就像这样，\n唱歌和跳舞的节奏也都要一模一样喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_06_1030_032emi", "source_sha256": "cd6eba41da168c9d755736b35cb300fdda08fd4cbcf69d114caef2cf66712656", "ja": "まつりさん……はい、そうですね！\n私とまつりさんの二人組、楽しんでまいりましょう！", "zh": "茉莉……是，没错呢！\n我要好好享受和茉莉组成的两人团体！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_06_1031_p", "source_sha256": "fa6e5bbe141c0023d8fe27ae394cdf14e9d817344259853782478354c65e5210", "ja": "（コンセプトは『双子のお姫様』……まつりが\nイメージしていたもの、今ならわかる気がするな）", "zh": "（主题是『双胞胎公主』……\n茉莉心里想像的模样，我现在似乎也能理解了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_06_1032_p", "source_sha256": "497cc0c5ce730dee44c78d7e7b40f47b620fa8151e4488a17ec0490e65acf699", "ja": "（ふたりがどんなステージを見せてくれるか、\n楽しみにしていよう！）", "zh": "（她们会为大家带来什么样的表演呢？\n我就好好期待吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
